{"title":"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The diagram shows part of a scale of a measuring device.  The arrow indicates an approximate reading of\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/a/eea86891575ef6a6c7c90ff41c59a2a847689a3b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((-3,0)..(0,3)..(3,0)); draw((-3.5,0)--(-2.5,0)); draw((0,2.5)--(0,3.5)); draw((2.5,0)--(3.5,0)); draw((1.8,1.8)--(2.5,2.5)); draw((-1.8,1.8)--(-2.5,2.5)); draw((0,0)--3*dir(120),EndArrow); label(&quot;$10$&quot;,(-2.6,0),E); label(&quot;$11$&quot;,(2.6,0),W); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"135\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/3/753dbd21e4fbd486ecd74abb186711c25f4c6a72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 10.05 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 10.15 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 10.25 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 10.3 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 10.6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"473\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since the scale is divided into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> equal sections, the marks to the left and right the arrow must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/3/4c3115f910a07e3f39c6f0afdf98cc24a5880d62.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10.25$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/3/993603b1792270368772988a9bce59ca6688cfb9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"34\" height=\"14\" />, respectively.  The only answer choice strictly between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/3/4c3115f910a07e3f39c6f0afdf98cc24a5880d62.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10.25$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/3/993603b1792270368772988a9bce59ca6688cfb9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"34\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/8/458e099fb7aefcf27e536fe6409d7d114f8b5330.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 10.3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"80\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME\" title=\"1988 AJHSME\">1988 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1988\">Resources</a>)\n</td></t